  "description": "In Ether, the wealthy enjoy life in luxury on a floating island called Skyland, while the poor are exploited in the desolate Lowlands below. Follow Nailah, a Lowlander adopted into Skyland, on her journey to becoming the Elysian — the leader of the aristocracy who ensures the land's prosperity. However, an unexpected incident shatters Nailah's dreams, making them seem impossible to reach—but she refuses to give up.",
